   "items": [
    {
     "date": "2026-10-01",
     "name": "ECI letter No. 23/2025/ERS(Vol-II), 01.10.2026, to the Chief Electoral Officers of all States/UTs, 'Special drive in States/UTs after completion of Special Intensive Revision (SIR)', paras 3 and 4(ii)",
     "quote": "Voter enrolment is a continuous process and any person not yet enrolled in the electoral roll or whose name has got deleted can apply for enrolment at any point of time. ... BLOs shall undertake House-to-House (H2H) visits in respect of such identified electors to ascertain their present status and facilitate enrolment through Form 6, wherever the person is found to be eligible.",
